Third-Party Baseline Attributions:
- MetaRS modules (`unified_robust_exp/code/module/baseline/MetaRS.py` and `base_metars/`) are adapted from the official MetaRS release (Zhou et al., Remote Sensing of Environment, 2026).
- STARS architecture (`unified_robust_exp/code/module/baseline/stars.py`) is adapted from https://github.com/CVEO/STARS (Wang et al., Int. J. Appl. Earth Obs. Geoinf., 2026) with the paper's objective equations under our shared evaluation protocol.
- PAD (`PADFusionR50`) and ShaSpec (`ShaSpec`) in `revision_baselines.py` follow Zheng et al. (IEEE TGRS, 2025) and Wang et al. (CVPR, 2023).
